{% set engagementCandidates = ttm_get_propose_engagement_candidates(npc.UUID) %}
{% set loversBecomingEx = ttm_get_lovers_becoming_ex(npc.UUID) %}
{% set datingPartner = ttm_get_dating_partner(npc.UUID) %}

{% if engagementCandidates != "" %}Available actors for engagement: {{engagementCandidates}}{% endif %}

Engagement is a serious, binding commitment that definitively leads to marriage — more formal than dating, the final step before marriage.
{% if loversBecomingEx %}
NOTE: {{speakingNpc.name}} currently has lover(s): {{loversBecomingEx}}. Proposing this engagement will end those lover arrangements — they will become ex-lovers.
{% endif %}
USE ONLY when {{speakingNpc.name}} is ready to explicitly propose engagement to a partner.
{% if datingPartner != "" %}
NEVER propose engagement to anyone other than {{datingPartner}}.
{% endif %}
NEVER use for flirting, compliments, or any proposal not leading to marriage.
NEVER confuse with proposing a dating relationship (romantic, less formal) or lovers relationship (sexual, casual).

